error_signature: "error: 'uint8_t' is not a member of 'std'; did you mean 'wint_t'?"
root_cause: "shrinkwrap 1.2.0 头文件使用 std::uint8_t/std::uint64_t 但不 include <cstdint>；libc++（OHOS）经 <array>/<vector>/<iostream> 传递引入所以能编译，libstdc++（g++）无传递包含直接失败。"
rec_approach: "OHOS 无需补丁（libc++ 不受影响）；libstdc++ 环境验证用 g++ -include cstdint 绕过；根治为 5 个头文件各加 #include <cstdint>（可直接上游）。"
match_keywords: ["uint8_t is not a member of std", "cstdint", "libc++", "libstdc++", "header-only", "shrinkwrap"]
error_excerpt: "include/shrinkwrap/xz.hpp:323:23: error: 'uint8_t' is not a member of 'std'; did you mean 'wint_t'?"
severity: P2
category: portability
last_updated: 2026-09-27
